        // EOAs. The reference won't revert for EOAs either, but we need the mutant to
        // revert for SOME input. With `caller.code.length > 0`, many contracts accept
        // 0 value (precompiles like ecRecover accept 0 value). But some precompiles
        // reject value, like 0x02 (SHA256) reverts on value transfer. The fuzzer may
